title: Harden path quoting and cover it with tests
updated: 2026-08-13T04:40:10Z
---

_q() single-quotes and escapes embedded quotes for every interpolated path -- except Fs::LibSSH::glob, whose pattern must stay unquoted so the remote shell expands it. That asymmetry is the security-relevant line in the distribution and has no test.

Cover: paths with spaces, single quotes, $, backticks and newlines through is_file/stat/unlink/upload; and what glob does with a hostile pattern. These commands run as root on Hetzner dedicated servers via Rex::GPU and Rex::Rancher.
